Text("<div style='font-size:18px;color:#FF0000;text-align:center'>$Attracteur \\; de \\; Gumowski-Mira$\n$(CERN)$\n<div style='color:#0000FF'>\n$x_{n+1}=by_n+f(x_n)$\n$y_{n+1}=-x_n+f(x_{n+1})$\n<div style='text-align:left;color:#6600FF'>\n$avec$\n<div style='text-align:center'>\n$\\displaystyle f(x) = ax+\\frac{2(1-a)x^2}{1+x^2}\n",31,133,334,259,"c:rgba(215,232,122,0.18);s:3;r:15;p:4");
